gabn(){return"Claras helps you split the costs of your plans (trips, roommates, nights out) and tells you clearly who owes whom, in just a few payments.\n\nNo sign-up: just jump right in, no email or password. When online, Claras opens an anonymous session in the cloud (a random ID, without your name or email) so it can sync. Your groups live on your phone; only the ones you share or join are stored in the cloud, with their receipt photos and change history, so their members can see them (only people with the code). Your key and QR travel only if you choose to share them, and copies of your receipts only if you accept \u201cHelp improve Claras\u201d. Amounts are in each group's currency.\n\nClaras also counts, per day, how many times some features are used (like adding an expense or opening Claras Pro), without names, amounts or anything that says who you are.\n\nIt's just a little help with the math; double-check the figures before you pay."},
